<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Read-Rite cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Read-Rite cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it downgraded Read-Rite Corp to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst Paul Weinstein was not immediately available to provide additional details.</p>
<p>-- Read-Rite lost 1-10/16 to 20-9/16.</p>
</text>
